      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true, given that $A$ is a $4\\times 4$ matrix and $det(A)=-1$?\n\nI. $A\\text{ is not invertible}$\n\nII. $\\text{rank}(A)=4$\n\nIII. $A\\text{ does not have }4\\text{ pivot columns}$",
